{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09776","headline":"送李别将摄伊吾令充使赴武威便寄崔员外 · 岑参","name":"送李别将摄伊吾令充使赴武威便寄崔员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"词赋满书囊，胡爲在战场。\n行间脱宝劒，邑里挂铜章。\n马疾飞千里，凫飞向五凉。\n遥知竹林下，星使对星郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}